### Props

| Prop | Type | Default | Required |Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `action` | `Function` | `undefined` | `true` | The async function to execute when clicked. |
| `requireAreYouSure` | `Boolean` | `'default'` | `false` | Add require are you sure alert dialog. |
| `couldCloseAutomatically` | `Boolean` | `'default'` | `false` | Close automatically the alert dialog. |
| `toastOptions` | `Object` | `{position: 'bottom-right'}` | `false` | Toast feedback options. |
| `dialogOptions` | `Object` | `{title: 'Are you sure?', description: 'This action cannot be undone', cancelButtonText: 'Cancel', confirmButtonText: 'Confirm'}` | `false` | Alert dialog options. |

### Slots

| Slot | Description |
| :--- | :--- |
| `text` | The text of the button. |
| `icon` | An optional icon to display. |

